Atrium: the Atrium streaming output in the compositor: atrium_stream_target.c (render -> NV12 ->
Vulkan Video H.264 -> ALVR server_core) built into comp_main with the Atrium stream driver, and its
factory first in the target list (detected only with ATRIUM_STREAM=1).

